        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barney Greenway, Jens Kidman\n- Organizations: Napalm Death, Extreme Noise Terror, Benediction\n- Products: Hypomanic, \"Totalitarian\"\n- Platforms: YouTube\n\nFacts:\n- Jens Kidman was born on 8 June 1966 and is a Swedish metal vocalist.\n- Barney Greenway was born on 13 July 1969 and is a British extreme metal vocalist.\n- Barney Greenway has been a member of Napalm Death, Extreme Noise Terror, and Benediction.\n- A video for the song \"Totalitarian\" from Hypomanic was made for YouTube and featured a guest appearance by Barney Greenway of Napalm Death.",
